{"seq":1,"slug":"first-principles","title":"第一性原理","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/elon-musk/ideas-and-methods/first-principles","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"first-principles-thinking","title":"第一性原理思维","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/elon-musk/ideas-and-methods/first-principles/first-principles-thinking","wordCount":1823,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"physics-as-a-framework","title":"物理学的思维框架","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/elon-musk/ideas-and-methods/first-principles/physics-as-a-framework","wordCount":1502,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"第一性原理\">第一性原理</h1><p>马斯克突破常规、屡解难题的思维利器，是源自物理学的第一性原理思考。本章剖析这一思维方法。</p>\n<p>第一篇文档讲述&quot;第一性原理思维&quot;——他如何把问题剥离到最基本的事实，再从根本出发重新构建答案。第二篇文档讲述&quot;物理学的思维框架&quot;，揭示物理学训练如何奠定他理解世界、判断可行性的底层方法。</p>\n"}